{"key":"t65-bio-x3","kind":"mcq","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"The frequency of alleles for dark color increases in the population.","working":"Dark-colored beetles have a survival advantage on darkened bark because birds prey less on them. Since color is heritable, dark beetles are more likely to survive and reproduce, passing alleles for dark color to offspring. Over many generations, natural selection increases the frequency of dark-color alleles in the population. Choice A is incorrect because individual beetles cannot change their inherited color. Choice C ignores differential survival. Choice D is implausible, especially within one generation.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":465,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":81,"cacheReadTokens":384},"outputTokens":304,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":130,"reasoningTokens":174},"totalTokens":769,"raw":{"prompt_tokens":465,"completion_tokens":304,"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":81,"total_tokens":769,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":174}},"reasoningTokens":174,"cachedInputTokens":384},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":5505,"keyed_label":"B"}
{"key":"t65-bio-x3","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"B","final_answer":"The frequency of alleles for dark color increases in the population.","working":"According to the theory of evolution by natural selection, individuals with traits that confer higher survival and reproductive success in a given environment are more likely to pass those heritable traits to the next generation. Because dark bark makes light-colored beetles more visible to predatory birds, dark-colored beetles have a survival advantage. Since color is heritable, the proportion of individuals with the dark phenotype and the frequency of alleles conferring dark coloration will increase over multiple generations.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":413,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":413,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":314,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":134,"reasoningTokens":180},"totalTokens":727,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":180,"promptTokenCount":413,"candidatesTokenCount":134,"totalTokenCount":727,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":413}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":134}]},"reasoningTokens":180,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":3972,"keyed_label":"B"}
